        "description": "<div id=\"link_wrapped_content\">\n<body><section class=\"wp-block-bigbite-multi-title\"><div class=\"container\"></div></section>\n\n\n\n<p>Instead of downgrading its most affordable Claude subscription plan by dropping access to Claude Code, Anthropic has instead doubled Claude Code usage rates for subscribers, starting today. All it took was an eyebrow-raising alliance with an unlikely partner.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>On day one of the Code with Claude developer conference in San Francisco, Anthropic announced it had struck a deal with SpaceX that will \u201csubstantially increase\u201d Anthropic\u2019s computing capacity.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Thanks to the deal, Anthropic says it will <a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/higher-limits-spacex\">double Claude Code five-hour usage limits</a> for Claude Pro, Max, Team, and seat-based Enterprise plans, while also raising pay-per-token API rate limits for Claude\u2019s powerful Opus models. No mention was made of weekly Claude Code limits. I\u2019ve reached out to Anthropic for more details.</p",
