        "description": "<div id=\"link_wrapped_content\">\n<body><section class=\"wp-block-bigbite-multi-title\"><div class=\"container\"></div></section>\n\n\n\n<p>If you\u2019ve ever tried to change your volume in Windows and ended up clicking through a maze of menus, you know how clunky it feels. Something as simple as adjusting sound shouldn\u2019t take that much effort, but somehow it still does.\u00a0</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Enter <a href=\"https://eartrumpet.app/\">EarTrumpet</a>. It\u2019s a free app that gives you full control over your PC\u2019s audio, without the usual hassle. It replaces the basic Windows volume mixer with easy-to-use sound functions. Instead of one clunky slider, you get clean, separate controls for every app playing sound on your PC.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>So if your sweet ambient background music is too loud but the YouTube video on your browser is too quiet, you can fix it in seconds. No digging through settings or switching between each app or window to change the volume controls.</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"extendedBlock-wrapper block-coreImage un",
